Rustica's wallpapers, in QOI (qoiformat.org), the format the compositor
reads:

  rustica-fox.qoi            the default, landscape screens (1207x941)
  rustica-fox-portrait.qoi   the default, portrait screens and the mobile
                             edition (451x941)

The fox artwork was given to the project by its owner (2026-11-24) as
Rustica's default wallpaper. Settings > Appearance turns another picture
(PNG, JPEG or QOI) into ~/.config/rustica/wallpaper.qoi.
